        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"6ceeda8d-be8e-42f8-a815-e22fea0fc973\",\"review_text\":\"Easy to navigate great selection\"},{\"review_id\":\"27e9c5a3-b94c-47f0-b35f-a9211718557c\",\"review_text\":\"🤟🏽🤟🏽\"},{\"review_id\":\"531f7453-2f42-432c-a18a-a7b3dcf812ca\",\"review_text\":\"🤙🤙🤙🤙🤙\"},{\"review_id\":\"47816d28-b47f-4313-aad9-30a4b5f3b022\",\"review_text\":\"This app should be 5 stars, and it is. I'm amending my previous review because the issues I had with it have been changed. It's well worth paying for no commercials. I like the integration with playstation so I can listen to my playlists while gaming.\"},{\"review_id\":\"a7506447-33c1-4eef-a99b-7835d5e9bf27\",\"review_text\":\"All features are enabled after buying Spotify premium 😐😕\"},{\"review_id\":\"84685ce2-7e0a-411a-af93-4623042c3e1e\",\"review_text\":\"Don't use this app so many ads interrupted as your listening now onwards this app pushing their explore premium as condittional better don't use this app go for another option\"},{\"review_id\":\"f0177d01-7ece-4925-8214-80bedad908ec\",\"review_text\":\"Thanks givings to the God 🙏🙏🙏\"},{\"review_id\":\"b52f6786-9497-43c2-a7ef-c9560722dd34\",\"review_text\":\"Es super aburrido ahora escuchas una o dos canciones y 3 anuncios\"},{\"review_id\":\"fe53e9f0-39a3-4c51-b9ed-d185a6afe2bd\",\"review_text\":\"I can't open the app. The screen just keeps flashing the Spotify Logo!!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"3ba33a52-9d6e-4193-b8f9-791dcba10b14\",\"review_text\":\"Beautiful experience using the app\"}]}"
